.claude/
*.jl.cov
*.jl.mem

# Extracted-feature caches. Reproducible from the scripts, 84 MB for Phase 10 alone, and tied
# to the Julia version that wrote them. The `.log` files beside them are the durable record.
FashionMNIST/cache/

# ConvNeXt experiment: a Python venv (~5 GB), 4 GB of raw stimuli, and derived features.
# All regenerable by the three scripts; the `.log` files are the durable record.
ConVNextTest/.venv/
ConVNextTest/data/
ConVNextTest/features/
ConVNextTest/cache/
ConVNextTest/results/
ConVNextTest/pipinstall.log
__pycache__/

# Self-contained HTML viewers built around a figure. The PNG beside them is the tracked
# artefact; these embed the same image as base64, so tracking both puts the figure in git
# twice and fills diffs with base64. Rebuild from the plotting script when needed.
ConVNextTest/figures/*.html

# Feature cache written by SimpleStrokeTests/Sweep_Capacity.jl. Regenerable, ~81 MB, and tied
# to the Julia version that wrote it. Should never have been tracked.
SimpleStrokeTests/sweep_cache/
